# 35. Performance

Overview must load quickly.

Initial data:

```text
Store Identity
Status
Health
Key Metrics
```

Lazy-load:

```text
Orders
Analytics
Activity
Inventory details
GEM details
```

Use:

* Server-side pagination
* Query projections
* Read models
* Caching where safe
* Parallel independent requests

Avoid N+1 queries.

