## Fundamental Rule

`Store Management` owns:

```text
Store identity
Store ownership
Store lifecycle
Store administration
```

`Store Details` owns:

```text
The administrative control surface for one store
```

Other bounded contexts own:

```text
Catalog      → Products
Inventory    → Stock
Orders       → Orders
POS          → Point of Sale
Payment      → Payment
Shipping     → Fulfillment
Tax          → Tax
CMS          → Content
SEO          → Search optimization
Analytics    → Measurement
GEM          → Advertising intelligence
Notifications→ Delivery
Finance      → Financial truth
```

The UI may unify these areas, but the domain architecture must remain separated.
